# HVF, virtualization=on
eret to EL0 with HCR_EL2.TGE=1, then svc
svc from EL0 taken to EL1 (TGE NOT honored)
# HVF, virtualization=on, HCR_EL2.E2H also set (tge-e2h)
eret to EL0 with HCR_EL2.TGE=1, then svc
svc from EL0 taken to EL1 (TGE NOT honored)
# TCG control: -machine virt,gic-version=3,virtualization=on -cpu max
eret to EL0 with HCR_EL2.TGE=1, then svc
svc from EL0 taken to EL2 (TGE honored)
